---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="使用指南" titleEn="Guide">
  <section class="container public-inner-hero guide-hero" aria-labelledby="guide-heading">
    <div class="public-hero-copy">
      <div class="public-kicker"><span class="public-kicker-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-zh="GET STARTED / 使用指南">GET STARTED / GUIDE</span></div>
      <h1 id="guide-heading" data-site-text="guideTitle" data-zh="从一条更好的回复开始。">Make the next reply yours.</h1>
      <p class="lead" data-site-text="guide" data-zh="安装插件，连接账户，设置你的风格，然后在 X 回复框中生成草稿。">Install the extension, connect your account, set your voice, and generate drafts in an X reply box.</p>
      <div class="guide-actions">
        <a class="button" data-site-link="chromeStoreUrl" aria-disabled="true"><span data-site-text="guideCta" data-zh="从 Chrome 应用商店安装">Install from Chrome Web Store</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="button secondary" data-site-link="xTutorialUrl" data-site-hide-if-empty="true" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden><span data-zh="查看 X 图文教程">View X Tutorial</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="public-hero-fineprint" data-zh="无需自行配置 API Key · 由你确认发送">No personal API key · You approve every send</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="public-hero-visual guide-preview" aria-label="Visual summary of the reply workflow">
      <div class="mini-panel-head"><img src="/favicon.svg" width="30" height="30" alt="" /><div><strong>x-Reply-Helper</strong><span data-zh="AI 创作者回复助手">AI creator reply assistant</span></div><span class="mini-panel-pro">X</span></div>
      <div class="mini-guide-label" data-zh="三步完成你的第一条回复">THREE STEPS · ONE BETTER REPLY</div>
      <div class="mini-guide-row"><span class="mini-step-number">01</span><span data-zh="连接官网账户">Connect your account</span><span class="mini-step-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div>
      <div class="mini-guide-row"><span class="mini-step-number">02</span><span data-zh="选择个人表达风格">Set your personal voice</span><span class="mini-step-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div>
      <div class="mini-guide-row"><span class="mini-step-number">03</span><span data-zh="检查草稿，自己决定发送">Review the draft, then send</span><span class="mini-step-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
      <div class="mini-guide-bottom"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span data-zh="自然 · 幽默 · 观点">Natural · Playful · Thoughtful</span></div>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="container public-content-section" aria-labelledby="guide-steps-heading">
    <div class="public-section-header"><div><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="完整使用流程">THE WORKFLOW</div><h2 id="guide-steps-heading" data-zh="三步上手，保持你的表达。">Three steps. Still your voice.</h2></div><p data-zh="不用改变习惯，只在需要的时候获得更好的建议。">No change to your habits. Just better suggestions when you need them.</p></div>
    <div class="grid-3 public-step-grid">
      <article class="feature-card public-step-card"><span class="step-number">01 / CONNECT</span><div class="public-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><h3 data-zh="安装并连接账户">Install and connect</h3><p data-zh="从 Chrome 应用商店安装插件，在设置中心登录与你官网相同的账户。">Install from the Chrome Web Store and sign in through Settings with the same account you use on this website.</p></article>
      <article class="feature-card public-step-card"><span class="step-number">02 / PERSONALIZE</span><div class="public-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</div><h3 data-zh="设置你的风格">Set your voice</h3><p data-zh="在中文设置中心填写 Voice Profile、兴趣和写作样本。AI 通过已连接的官网账户提供。">Add your Voice Profile, interests, and writing samples. AI is provided through your connected account.</p></article>
      <article class="feature-card public-step-card"><span class="step-number">03 / REVIEW</span><div class="public-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div><h3 data-zh="检查并发送">Review and send</h3><p data-zh="打开 X 帖子的回复框，选择建议、编辑文字，确认合适后由你自己点击发送。">Open a reply on X, choose a suggestion, edit it, then press Send yourself when ready.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container public-next-card">
    <div><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="探索更多">EXPLORE MORE</div><h2 data-zh="不止写好回复，下一条原创也值得蓄势。">Beyond replies: build momentum for the next original post.</h2><p data-zh="了解创始人提出的「互动势能临界值」理论。">Explore the founder's Creator Momentum Threshold framework.</p></div>
    <a href="/#creator-momentum" class="button secondary"><span data-zh="探索互动势能">Explore Creator Momentum</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>
</Base>